**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/

# src/Champ.Sim doubles as a Unity package, and Unity writes a .meta beside everything it
# finds there -- including a stray bin/ or obj/ from a dotnet build. The folders are ignored
# above; these are the meta files left pointing at them.
**/bin.meta
**/obj.meta

.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

